{
  "_comment": "PipeConnect screenshot capture — 18 slots designed cross-surface so each non-gameplay screen appears once. Showcases all 7 themes (Classic + Neon + Pastel + Midnight + Ocean + Inferno + Galaxy) with Midnight + Inferno + Galaxy unlocked via seed save state. Levels are distinct across every slot. Themes applied by writing palette directly to PIPE_COLORS (THEMES array lives in an IIFE).\n\nNon-gameplay screen distribution: Themes panel → phone 06 · Level Complete overlay → tablet_7 06 · Stats → tablet_10 06 · Level Select grid → tablet_7 03.",
